  "goodToKnow": "Der Rechtsstreit is a legal dispute or lawsuit: einen Rechtsstreit führen, gewinnen, beilegen (settle). Germans are said to be fond of litigation, and many have Rechtsschutzversicherung (legal costs insurance); neighbour disputes over hedges and noise (Nachbarschaftsstreit) are a classic. The losing party usually pays the legal costs. Der Streit means dispute. Plural: die Rechtsstreite or Rechtsstreitigkeiten."
